 something else. &amp;nbsp;But I am so glad I decided to do them, it just added such a nice touch to the ceremony. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I got a tremendous deal for www.linentablecloth.com, they had a 40% off sale, PLUS free shipping! &amp;nbsp;I got 40 organza sashes for $16.58! &amp;nbsp;I added some starfish to half the chairs to pull together the theme of the wedding. &amp;nbsp;I glued these pins&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.michaels.com\/bead-landing-bar-pin-1-inch\/M10443180.html?dwvar_M10443180_color=Gold#q=bar+pins&amp;amp;start=1&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.michaels.com\/bead-landing-bar-pin-1-inch\/M10443180.html?dwvar_M10443180_color=Gold#q=bar+pins&amp;amp;start=1&lt;\/a&gt;to 3\" starfish. &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899157,"PostDate":1435085193,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I really wavered back and forth if I was going to do chair sashes, I thought you know I could spend the money on something else. \u00a0But I am so glad I decided to do them, it just added such a nice touch to the ceremony. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I got a tremendous deal for www.linentablecloth.com, they had a 40% off sale, PLUS free shipping! \u00a0I got 40 organza sashes for $16.58! \u00a0I added some starfish to half the chairs to pull together the theme of the wedding. \u00a0I glued these pins\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.michaels.com\/bead-landing-bar-pin-1-inch\/M10443180.html?dwvar_M10443180_color=Gold#q=bar+pins&start=1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.michaels....ar pins&start=1<\/a>to 3\" starfish. <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899157]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-66602900-1435099418.jpg\" title=\"Chairs 1.jpg - Size: 149.94KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-66602900-1435099418.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Chairs 1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899157]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-57697200-1435099575.jpg\" title=\"chair 2.jpg - Size: 52.48KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-275203-0-57697200-1435099575.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"chair 2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trbutleress@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.152.210.240","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1384961990,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275203.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trbutler","Id":275203,"Name":"trbutler","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79308,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1eb4f1aba43208ee04fbfa16a4dc03c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my gosh that&#039;s gorgeous!!! I love that!! Are the sashes pink or coral? They look so pretty! Where did you get the starfish?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899169,"PostDate":1435095518,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh my gosh that's gorgeous!!! I love that!! Are the sashes pink or coral? They look so pretty! Where did you get the starfish?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.178.97.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79308,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa2d82bd89d52a5e24890b6b47c0ed23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;First snap was awesome. You chose the perfect color. I like pink organza chair sashes&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901786,"PostDate":1438652869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;