>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.94.52.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8967284f9ce3d48cc0ff1c73315fe60a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"khmciver\"] HAHAHA! OMG! 6?!?! Crazy girl! But such a good idea! I&#039;ll probably hit a thrift store and purchase a used suitcase to just leave there for the OOT bag stuff! My carry on is already going to be loaded with glass candle holders I&#039;m bringing for the reception dinner, so I&#039;m already expecting to be \"fully loaded\"! How many guests are you expecting, to have SIX extra suitcases of stuff?! (sorry if I missed this in any of your previous posts) I just hope I&#039;m not underestimating myself! :unsure:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876015,"PostDate":1413565263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@khmciver HAHAHA! OMG! 6?!?! Crazy girl! But such a good idea! I'll probably hit a thrift store and purchase a used suitcase to just leave there for the OOT bag stuff! My carry on is already going to be loaded with glass candle holders I'm bringing for the reception dinner, so I'm already expecting to be \"fully loaded\"! How many guests are you expecting, to have SIX extra suitcases of stuff?! (sorry if I missed this in any of your previous posts) I just hope I'm not underestimating myself! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"249e1357bc592d1450318742c9978b8c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennyZ\" post=\"1876000\" timestamp=\"1413572256\"]\nGreat ideas and inspiration! Thanks for sharing!!! :)\n\nI hope I didn&#039;t miss this if you posted already... But where did you find the mini Advil\/Tylenol?!![\/quote]\nFrom another Canadian, the ones on Amazon are usually only with shipping to USA :( I couldn&#039;t find much for us Canadians.  I ended up buying the little travel 10 packs from Dollarama for $2 each and found a lot at Walmart.\n\nUnless you live close to the border and can ship to a point in the USA and go and pick it all up!","Attachments":[],"Id":1876028,"PostDate":1413573644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennyZ, on 17 October 2014 - 02:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Great ideas and inspiration! Thanks for sharing!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I hope I didn't miss this if you posted already... But where did you find the mini Advil\/Tylenol?!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From another Canadian, the ones on Amazon are usually only with shipping to USA <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I couldn't find much for us Canadians. \u00a0I ended up buying the little travel 10 packs from Dollarama for $2 each and found a lot at Walmart.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unless you live close to the border and can ship to a point in the USA and go and pick it all up!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fabc644ff790699449b1197fa19f02b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JennyZ\"] I know! It&#039;s ridiculous!! We have 100 people coming so it&#039;s a lot. But it will be worth it!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876034,"PostDate":1413577561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280665\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280665-jennyz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JennyZ<\/span><\/a> I know! It's ridiculous!! We have 100 people coming so it's a lot. But it will be worth it!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"720a8999ac0617adef50bb46319b8057","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennyZ\" post=\"1876015\" timestamp=\"1413579663\"]\n@[member=\"khmciver\"] HAHAHA! OMG! 6?!?! Crazy girl! But such a good idea! I&#039;ll probably hit a thrift store and purchase a used suitcase to just leave there for the OOT bag stuff! My carry on is already going to be loaded with glass candle holders I&#039;m bringing for the reception dinner, so I&#039;m already expecting to be \"fully loaded\"! How many guests are you expecting, to have SIX extra suitcases of stuff?! (sorry if I missed this in any of your previous posts) I just hope I&#039;m not underestimating myself! :unsure:[\/quote]Canadian tire often has fantastic sales. We just got a 7 piece set for $84. Was 63% off.  Our thrift store near me wanted $75 for a used one. Wth?!?  We have 6-7 suitcases but since air Canada gave us first class 6 are included. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1876052,"PostDate":1413582913,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennyZ, on 17 October 2014 - 05:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@khmciver HAHAHA! OMG! 6?!?! Crazy girl! But such a good idea! I'll probably hit a thrift store and purchase a used suitcase to just leave there for the OOT bag stuff! My carry on is already going to be loaded with glass candle holders I'm bringing for the reception dinner, so I'm already expecting to be \"fully loaded\"! How many guests are you expecting, to have SIX extra suitcases of stuff?! (sorry if I missed this in any of your previous posts) I just hope I'm not underestimating myself! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/unsure.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':unsure:' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCanadian tire often has fantastic sales. We just got a 7 piece set for $84. Was 63% off.  Our thrift store near me wanted $75 for a used one. Wth?!?  We have 6-7 suitcases but since air Canada gave us first class 6 are included. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.94.52.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40736d38e7a59f7d124663af63755248","RawContent":"@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - Thanks for the info! That&#039;s totally what I was thinking and have no where close to the USA to ship to. I did see the little tubes at Dollarama and thought maybe they would be perfect, because if anyone parties like I do, they&#039;ll be needing more than 2 Tylenol&#039;s each! :lol:  I think that answers that!!! :D\n[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1876028\" timestamp=\"1413588044\"]\nFrom another Canadian, the ones on Amazon are usually only with shipping to USA :( I couldn&#039;t find much for us Canadians.  I ended up buying the little travel 10 packs from Dollarama for $2 each and found a lot at Walmart.\n\nUnless you live close to the border and can ship to a point in the USA and go and pick it all up![\/quote]\n@[member=\"khmciver\"] - Oh my goodness girl! Congrats on the success on your wedding guests!!! I&#039;ll be lucky if I get 20-30 MAX! Some of mine are even wanting to book their own flights\/resorts, even after I found the most AMAZING deals available! But that&#039;s a whole other forum post\/rant..... grrr :angry: lol! So with saying that! I&#039;m sure 1 extra suitcase will do me just fine!!! (Especially if I dont have to do OOT bags for the @ssh%les who want to stress out my wedding plans! haha! :P )\nSounds like you have the most amazing event approaching! Wishing you all the best for your special day!!! :wub:\n[quote name=\"khmciver\" post=\"1876034\" timestamp=\"1413591961\"]\n@[member=\"JennyZ\"] I know! It&#039;s ridiculous!! We have 100 people coming so it&#039;s a lot. But it will be worth it!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1876057,"PostDate":1413588392,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - Thanks for the info! That's totally what I was thinking and have no where close to the USA to ship to. I did see the little tubes at Dollarama and thought maybe they would be perfect, because if anyone parties like I do, they'll be needing more than 2 Tylenol's each! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\u00a0 I think that answers that!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 17 October 2014 - 07:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>From another Canadian, the ones on Amazon are usually only with shipping to USA <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> I couldn't find much for us Canadians. \u00a0I ended up buying the little travel 10 packs from Dollarama for $2 each and found a lot at Walmart.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Unless you live close to the border and can ship to a point in the USA and go and pick it all up!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p>@khmciver - Oh my goodness girl! Congrats on the success on your wedding guests!!! I'll be lucky if I get 20-30 MAX! Some of mine are even wanting to book their own flights\/resorts, even after I found the most AMAZING deals available! But that's a whole other forum post\/rant..... grrr <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/angry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':angry:' \/> lol! So with saying that! I'm sure 1 extra suitcase will do me just fine!!! (Especially if I dont have to do OOT bags for the @ssh%les who want to stress out my wedding plans! haha! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> )<\/p>\n<p>Sounds like you have the most amazing event approaching! Wishing you all the best for your special day!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>khmciver, on 17 October 2014 - 08:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280665\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280665-jennyz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JennyZ<\/span><\/a> I know! It's ridiculous!! We have 100 people coming so it's a lot. But it will be worth it!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abcafc3b611ee63b4280cf327cba4458","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennyZ\" post=\"1876057\" timestamp=\"1413602792\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - Thanks for the info! That&#039;s totally what I was thinking and have no where close to the USA to ship to. I did see the little tubes at Dollarama and thought maybe they would be perfect, because if anyone parties like I do, they&#039;ll be needing more than 2 Tylenol&#039;s each! :lol:  I think that answers that!!! :D\n\n\n@[member=\"khmciver\"] - Oh my goodness girl! Congrats on the success on your wedding guests!!! I&#039;ll be lucky if I get 20-30 MAX! Some of mine are even wanting to book their own flights\/resorts, even after I found the most AMAZING deals available! But that&#039;s a whole other forum post\/rant..... grrr :angry: lol! So with saying that! I&#039;m sure 1 extra suitcase will do me just fine!!! (Especially if I dont have to do OOT bags for the @ssh%les who want to stress out my wedding plans! haha! :P )\nSounds like you have the most amazing event approaching! Wishing you all the best for your special day!!! :wub:[\/quote]At one point we thought we&#039;d be the only 2 there and we have atleast 43! Some are thinking of booking now that we are in the home stretch. 3 months today!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1876058,"PostDate":1413588508,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennyZ, on 17 October 2014 - 11:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - Thanks for the info! That's totally what I was thinking and have no where close to the USA to ship to. I did see the little tubes at Dollarama and thought maybe they would be perfect, because if anyone parties like I do, they'll be needing more than 2 Tylenol's each! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>  I think that answers that!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><br><br><br>\n@khmciver - Oh my goodness girl! Congrats on the success on your wedding guests!!! I'll be lucky if I get 20-30 MAX! Some of mine are even wanting to book their own flights\/resorts, even after I found the most AMAZING deals available! But that's a whole other forum post\/rant..... grrr <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/angry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':angry:' \/> lol! So with saying that! I'm sure 1 extra suitcase will do me just fine!!! (Especially if I dont have to do OOT bags for the @ssh%les who want to stress out my wedding plans! haha! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/> )<br>\nSounds like you have the most amazing event approaching! Wishing you all the best for your special day!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nAt one point we thought we'd be the only 2 there and we have atleast 43! Some are thinking of booking now that we are in the home stretch. 3 months today!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.94.52.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc2c04e27b96ab6b937649021b7546b9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1876052\" timestamp=\"1413597313\"]\nCanadian tire often has fantastic sales. We just got a 7 piece set for $84. Was 63% off. Our thrift store near me wanted $75 for a used one. Wth?!? We have 6-7 suitcases but since air Canada gave us first class 6 are included.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] How did you manage to get first class??? I&#039;m also flying with Air Canada and could use that hook up to transport all my bits! lol! :lol:","Attachments":[],"Id":1876059,"PostDate":1413588576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 17 October 2014 - 09:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Canadian tire often has fantastic sales. We just got a 7 piece set for $84. Was 63% off. Our thrift store near me wanted $75 for a used one. Wth?!? We have 6-7 suitcases but since air Canada gave us first class 6 are included.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> How did you manage to get first class??? I'm also flying with Air Canada and could use that hook up to transport all my bits! lol! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.222.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1413590109,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cbaf37433ba97e6b7ece024201d0d7c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JennyZ\" post=\"1876059\" timestamp=\"1413602976\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] How did you manage to get first class??? I&#039;m also flying with Air Canada and could use that hook up to transport all my bits! lol! :lol:[\/quote]Not sure?!? My travel agent said we got it. \nMaybe see if yours can hook you up!\nWe also get every 17 person free!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1876060,"PostDate":1413589780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JennyZ, on 17 October 2014 - 11:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> How did you manage to get first class??? I'm also flying with Air Canada and could use that hook up to transport all my bits! lol! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\nNot sure?!? My travel agent said we got it. <br>\nMaybe see if yours can hook you up!<br>\nWe also get every 17 person free!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.94.52.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcf4c5662a08cd00c47d9c6bd7147fd0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1876058\" timestamp=\"1413602908\"]\nAt one point we thought we&#039;d be the only 2 there and we have atleast 43! Some are thinking of booking now that we are in the home stretch. 3 months today!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] - WOOHOO! 3 months! Down to the crunch time girl!!!  :D  All of my guests need to put a $250 deposit down with our travel agency by December 2014 in order to get the early booking bonus we received, otherwise they&#039;ll be paying [u]at least[\/u] $200 per person more than the deal we have. A lot aren&#039;t really getting this and think they&#039;ll find better deals themselves.... I try to remind myself not to stress about not knowing who&#039;s coming (especially so far away from the wedding date) but how are you suppose to plan your budget\/make all these bags\/order supplies, when so many people wait last minute?! &amp;lt;_&amp;lt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876064,"PostDate":1413591582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 17 October 2014 - 11:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>At one point we thought we'd be the only 2 there and we have atleast 43! Some are thinking of booking now that we are in the home stretch. 3 months today!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> - WOOHOO! 3 months! Down to the crunch time girl!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0 All of my guests need to put a $250 deposit down with our travel agency by December 2014 in order to get the early booking bonus we received, otherwise they'll be paying <u>at least<\/u> $200 per person more than the deal we have. A lot aren't really getting this and think they'll find better deals themselves.... I try to remind myself not to stress about not knowing who's coming (especially so far away from the wedding date) but how are you suppose to plan your budget\/make all these bags\/order supplies, when so many people wait last minute?! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/dry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='<_<' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#0066cc;\"><strong>- Jennifer and Fr<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>d<span><em>\u00e9<\/em><\/span>ric -<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>Playa del Carmen Mexico<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,204,204);\"><strong>December 1st, 2015<\/strong><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wedding@jennyfer.ca","IpAddress":"216.16.242.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413457548,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280665.jpg?_r=1413805399","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyZ","Id":280665,"Name":"JennyZ","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":63,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
