nks for sharing&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880778,"PostDate":1418925369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love them!! You did an amazing job. Thanks for sharing\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.57.32.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a527392291dea8abae62c29fff179e6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I absolutely love your bags! I actually would love some templates sent to me! Also, in case I missed it, how much did each full bag cost to make? thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880797,"PostDate":1418960241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I absolutely love your bags! I actually would love some templates sent to me! Also, in case I missed it, how much did each full bag cost to make? thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tambatzel@aim.com","IpAddress":"209.57.32.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418959444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tbatz","Id":281446,"Name":"tbatz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.134.151.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b82c9868de6b1c05f3f7ddbfeb74157e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"khmciver\" post=\"1875711\" timestamp=\"1413317742\"]\nThanks everyone!!\n\n@[member=\"acw271011\"] Thanks!! I got the bags from Ebay, but I saw them on another website too. If you want me to try to find it, let me know. I&#039;m happy to! I think they were about $3\/bag. \n\n@[member=\"AyeWatSoon\"] I got the bug spray at this site - [url=\"http:\/\/www.anypromo.com\/personal-care\/sanitizer\/spray-pen-25-oz-hand-sanitizer-p680363\"]http:\/\/www.anypromo.com\/personal-care\/sanitizer\/spray-pen-25-oz-hand-sanitizer-p680363[\/url]. I paid $180 total for 150 of them, which included my logo design on them, shipping, etc. \n\n@[member=\"kjb123\"] I am actually taking everything down there. Nightmare. I know. I have divided everything up and I have two other people taking some since I can&#039;t take it all with me. I checked with my travel agent and my wedding coordinator and they said I shouldn&#039;t have a problem getting it all in, especially since it&#039;s for a wedding. I&#039;m just keeping my fingers crossed.[\/quote]\n\nDYING TO KNOW .. did you have any trouble getting it in this is what I&#039;m most worried about it spending all the time and money making them and then having customs take them or charge tazes on them ...? I have heard of girls making fake recipets and taking them with you incase you get stopped. I would love to hear how everything actaully turned out!\n\nPS Your bags are amazing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1885550,"PostDate":1423315571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>khmciver, on 14 October 2014 - 04:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks everyone!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> Thanks!! I got the bags from Ebay, but I saw them on another website too. If you want me to try to find it, let me know. I'm happy to! I think they were about $3\/bag.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276925\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276925-ayewatsoon\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AyeWatSoon<\/span><\/a> I got the bug spray at this site -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.anypromo.com\/personal-care\/sanitizer\/spray-pen-25-oz-hand-sanitizer-p680363' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.anypromo....nitizer-p680363<\/a>. I paid $180 total for 150 of them, which included my logo design on them, shipping, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276061\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276061-kjb123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kjb123<\/span><\/a> I am actually taking everything down there. Nightmare. I know. I have divided everything up and I have two other people taking some since I can't take it all with me. I checked with my travel agent and my wedding coordinator and they said I shouldn't have a problem getting it all in, especially since it's for a wedding. I'm just keeping my fingers crossed.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>DYING TO KNOW .. did you have any trouble getting it in this is what I'm most worried about it spending all the time and money making them and then having customs take them or charge tazes on them ...? I have heard of girls making fake recipets and taking them with you incase you get stopped. I would love to hear how everything actaully turned out!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>PS Your bags are amazing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\n\u00a0","Email":"keegan.steele@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.134.151.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423275359,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"473a3351203daeb6779863bb38e2c88a","RawContent":"@[member=\"SteeleTheSpotlight\"]\n\n\nI got so lucky!!! All 10 suitcases made it! I did take a fake excel spreadsheet with made up prices. Ha! But I got the green light and just kept walking. They didn&#039;t even look. I won&#039;t lie. I was so nervous!!! But I think they really don&#039;t care bc they know there are so many weddings.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885565,"PostDate":1423320633,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282025\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282025-steelethespotlight\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SteeleTheSpotlight<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nI got so lucky!!! All 10 suitcases made it! I did take a fake excel spreadsheet with made up prices. Ha! But I got the green light and just kept walking. They didn't even look. I won't lie. I was so nervous!!! But I think they really don't care bc they know there are so many weddings. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Wedding Date: November 1, 2015<br>\nWedding Location: Azul Fives Hotel in Playa del Carmen<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Photos in Cancun - Derek Campbell<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com'>http:\/\/www.photosincancun.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Decoration Rentals: Love & Lace Wedding Decor<br>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/loveandlacedecor<\/a><\/p>\n<div>Wedding Photo Album: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10100809953124424.1073741834.18310150&type=1&l=581de87d2f<\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"khmciver@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.223.176.224","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1386793154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275598.jpg?_r=1426649427","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kellymenning","Id":275598,"Name":"kellymenning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d69b4fac883c159a777dcfaca8f604f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"khmciver\" post=\"1885565\" timestamp=\"1423335033\"]\n@[member=\"SteeleTheSpotlight\"]\n\nI got so lucky!!! All 10 suitcases made it! I did take a fake excel spreadsheet with made up prices. Ha! But I got the green light and just kept walking. They didn&#039;t even look. I won&#039;t lie. I was so nervous!!! But I think they really don&#039;t care bc they know there are so many weddings.[\/quote]\nAgree! and the brides on here who did get checked said they were in, searched, and out within 3-5 minutes.\n\nI had 11 bags and I was even hassled at the customs desk, then asked questions at security and STILL got the green light. I was sweating bullets though!  I wrote about this experience in my review that is coming soon, that whole experience in the Cancun airport with 11 bags and kids, and yelling customs ladies was very overwhelming!   \n\nThat said, I had all my receipts and wedding documents ready in case we did get searched.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885568,"PostDate":1423322777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>khmciver, on 07 February 2015 - 02:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282025\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282025-steelethespotlight\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SteeleTheSpotlight<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nI got so lucky!!! All 10 suitcases made it! I did take a fake excel spreadsheet with made up prices. Ha! But I got the green light and just kept walking. They didn't even look. I won't lie. I was so nervous!!! But I think they really don't care bc they know there are so many weddings.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Agree! and the brides on here who did get checked said they were in, searched, and out within 3-5 minutes.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had 11 bags and I was even hassled at the customs desk, then asked questions at security and STILL got the green light. I was sweating bullets though! \u00a0I wrote about this experience in my review that is coming soon, that whole experience in the Cancun airport with 11 bags and kids, and yelling customs ladies was very overwhelming! \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That said, I had all my receipts and wedding documents ready in case we did get searched.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.215.90.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dde7b0379665185b4ca6f1bb2de24a6d","RawContent":"Thanks so much for the info ... I&#039;m so nervous haha\n[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1885568\" timestamp=\"1423337177\"]\nAgree! and the brides on here who did get checked said they were in, searched, and out within 3-5 minutes.\n \nI had 11 bags and I was even hassled at the customs desk, then asked questions at security and STILL got the green light. I was sweating bullets though!  I wrote about this experience in my review that is coming soon, that whole experience in the Cancun airport with 11 bags and kids, and yelling customs ladies was very overwhelming!   \n \nThat said, I had all my receipts and wedding documents ready in case we did get searched.[\/quote]\nI will read it when you post it I will take all the tips I can get!","Attachments":[],"Id":1885605,"PostDate":1423357004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks so much for the info ... I'm so nervous haha<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 07 February 2015 - 03:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Agree! and the brides on here who did get checked said they were in, searched, and out within 3-5 minutes.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI had 11 bags and I was even hassled at the customs desk, then asked questions at security and STILL got the green light. I was sweating bullets though! \u00a0I wrote about this experience in my review that is coming soon, that whole experience in the Cancun airport with 11 bags and kids, and yelling customs ladies was very overwhelming! \u00a0\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThat said, I had all my receipts and wedding documents ready in case we did get searched.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nI will read it when you post it I will take all the tips I can get!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\n\u00a0","Email":"keegan.steele@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.134.151.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423275359,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78217,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64fd9f8dc7c1048fbf92813e965651c4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Your OOT bags are really well done! I love the tags that you&#039;ve attached to the handle of the bag. It&#039;s a really nice touch :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886222,"PostDate":1423760548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your OOT bags are really well done! I love the tags that you've attached to the handle of the bag. It's a really nice touch <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{