{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":"","Fields":[{"Label":"","Value":"<p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiancee and I got engaged on November 24,2014 in the park after watching our local santa clause parade.\u00a0 It was special because I had never been to a santa clause parade before because my parents are devout muslims.\u00a0 We grabbed some hot chocolate and had a walk through the park which we always did (usually in warmer weather, it was a bone chilling minus 15).\u00a0 We stopped at our favourite spot overlooking the credit river and that's where he got down on one knee.\u00a0 My answer was obviously yes, and here we are planning our wedding.\u00a0 I can't wait to spend the rest of my life with him.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning a destination wedding in sunny, tropical Cuba for October 2015.\u00a0 Our venue of choice is the Melia Cayo Santa Maria.\u00a0 My fiancee and I have been to Cuba twice.\u00a0 Our first trip was the the Melia Cayo Santa Maria in April and our second was to the Brisus Guardalava in December.\u00a0 We fell in love with Cuba on our first trip and it was also the first time we had been on vacation together.\u00a0 Also as a couple who loves to travel and explore new things we can't imagine being married anywhere else.<\/p>\n","Type":"string"}]},{"Title":"Community Stats","Fields":[{"Label":"Group","Value":"Jr. Member","Type":"string"},{"Label":"Active Posts","Value":230,"Type":"int"},{"Label":"Profile Views","Value":2628,"Type":"int"},{"Label":"Age","Value":26,"Type":"int"},{"Label":"Birthday","Value":614736000,"Type":"date"}]},{"Title":"Profile Information","Fields":[{"Label":"Location","Value":"Toronto","Type":"string"}]}],"Pages":null,"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
