> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79588,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a10aee6a2c6711f9d76457ab32dcfd7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kdepass2\" post=\"1904633\" timestamp=\"1442201912\"]\nThank god I found this website!! I was researching resort websites and getting so overwhelmed with so much information. My finace and I plan on getting married next October 2016. We THINK we are settled on Royalton White Sands Jamaica but can any ladies who got married there put my mind at ease by answering a few questions?\n\n1) We are hopefully looking for the cost for our guests to be no more than $1500 all-inclusive (flight and resort) for 7 days. Have others found this is plausible for this time? Sometimes it appears to be sitting more around the $1700 mark\n\n2) Just out of interest, how much did your wedding cost? We are looking at roughly 50 guests, just trying to budget\n\n3) Did you have a private reception, was it good?\n\n4) What kind of menu do they provide?\n\n5) How attentive is the wedding planner? Do they answer in a timely manner?\n\nIf you have any recent photos that would help please!!\n\nStressed-Out Researching Bride-to-Be,\n\nKathryn[\/quote]Kathryn,\n\nI was married in Negril but I&#039;ve heard good things about Royalton. I was there with my family in February and it is a great resort especially if you&#039;ll have young children in your group. \n\nYou may be lucky to get it for around $1500 depending but it may be closer to $1600. If you decide to get a travel agent, I can refer you to the one I used. She got prices a year out for me so she might be able to do the same for you. \n\nHappy planning.","Attachments":[],"Id":1905113,"PostDate":1442790423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kdepass2, on 13 September 2015 - 11:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank god I found this website!! I was researching resort websites and getting so overwhelmed with so much information. My finace and I plan on getting married next October 2016. We THINK we are settled on Royalton White Sands Jamaica but can any ladies who got married there put my mind at ease by answering a few questions?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) We are hopefully looking for the cost for our guests to be no more than $1500 all-inclusive (flight and resort) for 7 days. Have others found this is plausible for this time? Sometimes it appears to be sitting more around the $1700 mark<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2) Just out of interest, how much did your wedding cost? We are looking at roughly 50 guests, just trying to budget<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3) Did you have a private reception, was it good?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4) What kind of menu do they provide?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5) How attentive is the wedding planner? Do they answer in a timely manner?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have any recent photos that would help please!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Stressed-Out Researching Bride-to-Be,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Kathryn<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Kathryn,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was married in Negril but I've heard good things about Royalton. I was there with my family in February and it is a great resort especially if you'll have young children in your group.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You may be lucky to get it for around $1500 depending but it may be closer to $1600. If you decide to get a travel agent, I can refer you to the one I used. She got prices a year out for me so she might be able to do the same for you.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430519880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
