{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.141.252","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bff124346dda1a179d411bcdb9701a07","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Any 2015\/2016 Brides using MyfitnessPal app \/ website to loose weight before the wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m using it and I have lost 5 Lbs since I started keeping track on Jan 5th. Now I&#039;m starting to lose focus as I get busier and I&#039;m looking for&amp;nbsp;friends&amp;nbsp;with like minded goals to keep me&amp;nbsp;motivated. Going to pick up the Fitbit Charge HR today after work to see if that will help as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not much of a \"Crazy Diet\", \"Supplements\" or \"Crazy&amp;nbsp;Cleanse\" type person...I&#039;m on a eat right (sort of..most of the time..) and exercise kind of thing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone feels like joining or is already a member we could start a Best Destination Group and inspire each other to \"start sweating for the wedding\"&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883866,"PostDate":1422030339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Any 2015\/2016 Brides using MyfitnessPal app \/ website to loose weight before the wedding?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm using it and I have lost 5 Lbs since I started keeping track on Jan 5th. Now I'm starting to lose focus as I get busier and I'm looking for\u00a0friends\u00a0with like minded goals to keep me\u00a0motivated. Going to pick up the Fitbit Charge HR today after work to see if that will help as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not much of a \"Crazy Diet\", \"Supplements\" or \"Crazy\u00a0Cleanse\" type person...I'm on a eat right (sort of..most of the time..) and exercise kind of thing.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone feels like joining or is already a member we could start a Best Destination Group and inspire each other to \"start sweating for the wedding\"<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.136.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4d460022d837379ef2fda0d3967d9f6","RawContent":"I&#039;m on it, have been on and off for years.\n\n\nI&#039;ve found the only way I lose weight is by food tracking and running.  Neither which I enjoy lol.  My Crossfit gym is doing a Paleo challenge for the 3 weeks before the wedding, and while I&#039;m gone, and I figure it&#039;s a good way to motivate myself to eat more healthy.  It&#039;s unprocessed foods, focusing on protein\/veggies\/fruits\/good carbs. Not doing the whole30.  It&#039;s basically how I try to eat now, just no caffeine\/sugar.\n\n\nMfp is great for keeping you accountable. I&#039;d suggest not eating back calories, and overestimate when you can&#039;t exactly measure. And it&#039;s only good if you track everything, no cheating lol.\n\n\nI&#039;d be up for a group if you wanted to start it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1883893,"PostDate":1422044043,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm on it, have been on and off for years.<br><br>\nI've found the only way I lose weight is by food tracking and running.  Neither which I enjoy lol.  My Crossfit gym is doing a Paleo challenge for the 3 weeks before the wedding, and while I'm gone, and I figure it's a good way to motivate myself to eat more healthy.  It's unprocessed foods, focusing on protein\/veggies\/fruits\/good carbs. Not doing the whole30.  It's basically how I try to eat now, just no caffeine\/sugar.<br><br>\nMfp is great for keeping you accountable. I'd suggest not eating back calories, and overestimate when you can't exactly measure. And it's only good if you track everything, no cheating lol.<br><br>\nI'd be up for a group if you wanted to start it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.231.76.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f51de2c9a7a26bb29afa421b306b961","RawContent":"@[member=\"marinah84\"] I will start one this weekend :) if I can figure out how to do it :) my user name is diaryofadillydallier\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1883894,"PostDate":1422044655,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275696\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275696-marinah84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">marinah84<\/span><\/a> I will start one this weekend <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> if I can figure out how to do it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> my user name is diaryofadillydallier<br><br><br><br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"384a7669997a7f4070cdb955d60e8368","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t been using it, mostly due to laziness, but when I was I found that I lost the weight I wanted pretty quickly. I should pick it up again. I also want to get a fitbit to help me out :). I find it really difficult to eat healthy in winter. The last thing I want to eat are veggies and fruit :(.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of luck! I&#039;ll let you know if I start using it again, maybe I should go get that fitbit today :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883906,"PostDate":1422046877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I haven't been using it, mostly due to laziness, but when I was I found that I lost the weight I wanted pretty quickly. I should pick it up again. I also want to get a fitbit to help me out <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I find it really difficult to eat healthy in winter. The last thing I want to eat are veggies and fruit <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of luck! I'll let you know if I start using it again, maybe I should go get that fitbit today <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eba865d35f28d8342bb5c5f18e8abf27","RawContent":"@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] I got my Fitbit it&#039;s charging right now :) I&#039;m also very lazy so that why I need people to join me and keep me accountable lol\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1883910,"PostDate":1422051371,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> I got my Fitbit it's charging right now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm also very lazy so that why I need people to join me and keep me accountable lol<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef124c7a9955762d23e6bc7beda103ac","RawContent":"I lost 50 pounds using MyFitnessPal. Then, I maintained it for a year without it. Now that I have gotten engaged, I got back onto MyFitnessPal and lost 4 pounds in the first two weeks just by tracking calories. When I am tracking, I make better choices when it comes to small things. Since the small things add up, cutting those out makes the difference between maintaining and losing for me.\n\n\nI aim to eat my goal calories every day, no matter whether or not I workout. Therefore, the calories I burn with exercise leads to overall being below goal.","Attachments":[],"Id":1883911,"PostDate":1422055652,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I lost 50 pounds using MyFitnessPal. Then, I maintained it for a year without it. Now that I have gotten engaged, I got back onto MyFitnessPal and lost 4 pounds in the first two weeks just by tracking calories. When I am tracking, I make better choices when it comes to small things. Since the small things add up, cutting those out makes the difference between maintaining and losing for me.<br><br>\nI aim to eat my goal calories every day, no matter whether or not I workout. Therefore, the calories I burn with exercise leads to overall being below goal.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lm_sprowl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"75.26.164.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418261031,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2016","Id":281378,"Name":"cruisebride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.231.76.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4fe858b244f4399af87fa0c8a0731cd","RawContent":"@[member=\"cruisebride2016\"] that&#039;s awesome!  Such good advice...please add me as a friend on MFP if you like :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1883912,"PostDate":1422056194,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281378\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281378-cruisebride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cruisebride2016<\/span><\/a> that's awesome!  Such good advice...please add me as a friend on MFP if you like <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1ab896b25ccf876cb3fe21aa0c2bbfc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ok. I have to ask. What&#039;s a fitbit (sp)? I think I accidentally downloaded my fitness pal but I&#039;ve never used it lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883917,"PostDate":1422058813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ok. I have to ask. What's a fitbit (sp)? I think I accidentally downloaded my fitness pal but I've never used it lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.32.161.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8812f9ee6f1c8cdab719be27b8f026b7","RawContent":"Fitbit.com - it&#039;s a brand of wearable activity trackers that track things like steps, floors climbed, distance, heart rate, sleep, etc, depending on the model.\n\n\nI loooove mine!  I just upgraded to the charge hr, which tracks so much more than my flex.  I love the heart rate tracking for my workouts and floors\/sleep tracking!\n\n\nI don&#039;t know my map username, I have it saved on my phone app. I think it&#039;s marinaherbert84 tho...lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1883920,"PostDate":1422064558,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Fitbit.com - it's a brand of wearable activity trackers that track things like steps, floors climbed, distance, heart rate, sleep, etc, depending on the model.<br><br>\nI loooove mine!  I just upgraded to the charge hr, which tracks so much more than my flex.  I love the heart rate tracking for my workouts and floors\/sleep tracking!<br><br>\nI don't know my map username, I have it saved on my phone app. I think it's marinaherbert84 tho...lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" 