a ivory with gold\/champagne beading and my girls are wearing coral. I think I want them to wear beige pants and a white top but I&#039;m worried the white tops are just too plain... I would love to see some pics of other brides and what their guys wore with a similar gown! I&#039;ll try to attach pictures but my dress is Quincy by Maggie sottero and the girls are wearing from David&#039;s bridal Short Crinkle Chiffon Dress with Front Cascade in coral reef.\n\nAny suggestions is appreciated :)","Attachments":[{"Id":33498,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-33211100-1440374496.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-33211100-1440374496_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":1136},{"Id":33499,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-99712900-1440374509.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-99712900-1440374509_thumb.jpg","Width":554,"Height":891}],"Id":1903159,"PostDate":1440360116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi!<br>\nI am having a hard time deciding what colors to have my groom and his men to wear. My dress is a ivory with gold\/champagne beading and my girls are wearing coral. I think I want them to wear beige pants and a white top but I'm worried the white tops are just too plain... I would love to see some pics of other brides and what their guys wore with a similar gown! I'll try to attach pictures but my dress is Quincy by Maggie sottero and the girls are wearing from David's bridal Short Crinkle Chiffon Dress with Front Cascade in coral reef.<br>\nAny suggestions is appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ton_03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430216976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282892.jpg?_r=1434622094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsVanthof","Id":282892,"Name":"FutureMrsVanthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79525,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5069dae015eff155ffbf6e6d498b3bb4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My vote would be for grey for the guys. With coral it would really look good. Or you could also do navy with the coral. Both wold look great. Would you consider having them add a vest that would change the plain? You could still do the white shirts but the vest would break it up a bit. Just a thought.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903168,"PostDate":1440365631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My vote would be for grey for the guys. With coral it would really look good. Or you could also do navy with the coral. Both wold look great. Would you consider having them add a vest that would change the plain? You could still do the white shirts but the vest would break it up a bit. Just a thought.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.150.95.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79525,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96c5c4f7acb343aef1cf5b2164e7e4ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes, my hubs will most likely be wearing&amp;nbsp;a vest! What about a handkerchief? Bow tie and suspenders?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903210,"PostDate":1440414682,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes, my hubs will most likely be wearing\u00a0a vest! What about a handkerchief? Bow tie and suspenders?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79525,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50b05d8bbead5d391c3dd5a2ceb1421b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;All great suggestions so far! Linen and white are great options and you could always add a vest as mentioned above. Don&#039;t forget that a tie, bout, suspenders, vest can all add some color and break up the white too! I like the gray or navy blue suggestion also...depending on the other colors you might use in your theme, I think they both could compliment nicely.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We did linen pants and vests for our groomsmen with white dress shirt and a blush tie. Hubs wore the same but we added the jacket. The girls were in a bright pink\/red color (pomegrante from Alfred Angelo). The beading on my dress was more silvery than yours but I liked how it all came together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903252,"PostDate":1440424969,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>All great suggestions so far! Linen and white are great options and you could always add a vest as mentioned above. Don't forget that a tie, bout, suspenders, vest can all add some color and break up the white too! I like the gray or navy blue suggestion also...depending on the other colors you might use in your theme, I think they both could compliment nicely.<\/p>\n<p>We did linen pants and vests for our groomsmen with white dress shirt and a blush tie. Hubs wore the same but we added the jacket. The girls were in a bright pink\/red color (pomegrante from Alfred Angelo). The beading on my dress was more silvery than yours but I liked how it all came together.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79525","Title":"Groomsmen Suggestions !","LastPostDate":1440424969},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
