{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":118812,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"kuoling,\n\nNicoleB629 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Secrets the Vine - April 2016 Wedding\".\n\nNicoleB629 said:\n======================================================================\nHi KuoLing,\n \nI know!  I was thinking the same thing, I was hoping there would be other brides or past brides that we could talk to or see what their wedding looked like! \nWe booked the Ultimate Wedding package and have 45 people right now.  I think the max we will have is about 55-60 but there are still a few people that haven't booked yet.  I have 5 bridesmaids and they have all ordered their dresses already so I'm glad that's out of the way!  I did a save the date and I did purchase my dress!\n \nI have to figure out the photographer situation.  Did you book another photographer through the resort?  Were you going to get your hair and makeup done by someone at the resort? I agree, I chose destination because it was easier then a traditional wedding but there are some tricky parts to it!\n \nNicole\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11521&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":280754,"Name":"NicoleB629","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1443031401,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11521},{"Id":118317,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"kuoling,\n\nNicoleB629 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Secrets the Vine - April 2016 Wedding\".\n\nNicoleB629 said:\n======================================================================\nHi Kuoling,\n\nMy name is Nicole and I was searching this site for any info on past or future brides at Secrets the Vine!  I saw that you're getting married there April 2016....ME TOO!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I'm April 9th, when is your date? I haven't started planning anything yet, is your wedding planner Yamina? I'm not sure what the next steps are and I'm not sure if I am too early in trying to start planning it!\n\nHow has your experience been so far?  Have you started planning?  I was just starting to think about hair\/makeup for me and my bridesmaids. Hopefully we can share some information and help each other because I have NO idea!! lol\n\nThanks!\nNicole\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11521#msg20561\n","Sender":{"Id":280754,"Name":"NicoleB629","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442837776,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11521},{"Id":113812,"Title":"liked a post you made in Secrets The Vine Cancun Bri...","Message":"Hello!\n\nHunterDenaiMisko just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMe! I wonder who else?! Need some planning friends out there! I am getting married at Secrets The Vine in April 2016!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/72281-secrets-the-vine-cancun-brides-post-here\/?view=findpost&p=1902736\n","Sender":{"Id":284644,"Name":"HunterDenaiMisko","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284644.jpg?_r=1442378557","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1441141578,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":110828,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2016 Wedding At Cancun Mexi...","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you all for your input! Just want to give an update that I decided to go with....Secrets The Vine!  Funny how it's not even on my original list!\n \nI went site visits to Beach Palace, Sun Palace, Me Cancun, Fiesta Americana Condesa, Live Aqua and Secrets The Vine....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79063-2016-wedding-at-cancun-mexico-need-opinions-on-the-resorts\/?view=findpost&p=1902729\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1440401230,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":109064,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2016 Wedding At Cancun Mexi...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you all for your input! Just want to give an update that I decided to go with....Secrets The Vine!  Funny how it's not even on my original list!\n \nI went site visits to Beach Palace, Sun Palace, Me Cancun, Fiesta Americana Condesa, Live Aqua and Secrets The Vine....\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79063-2016-wedding-at-cancun-mexico-need-opinions-on-the-resorts\/?view=findpost&p=1902729\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1439839231,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"5","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
