> User kuoling (282701)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"OtherParticipants":[],"Messages":[{"Id":20561,"Author":{"Id":280754,"Name":"NicoleB629","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1442837776,"Content":"Hi Kuoling,<br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy name is Nicole and I was searching this site for any info on past or future brides at Secrets the Vine!  I saw that you're getting married there April 2016....ME TOO!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  I'm April 9th, when is your date? I haven't started planning anything yet, is your wedding planner Yamina? I'm not sure what the next steps are and I'm not sure if I am too early in trying to start planning it!<br \/>\n<br \/>\nHow has your experience been so far?  Have you started planning?  I was just starting to think about hair\/makeup for me and my bridesmaids. Hopefully we can share some information and help each other because I have NO idea!! lol<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThanks!<br \/>\nNicole","PostKey":"71a9b97efe1e450e8b149d3182a7e065","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20568,"Author":{"Id":282701,"Name":"kuoling","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282701.jpg?_r=1439869919","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1442861669,"Content":"<blockquote  class=\"ipsBlockquote\" data-author=\"NicoleB629\" data-time=\"1442866576\">\n<div>\n<p>Hi Kuoling,<br><br>\nMy name is Nicole and I was searching this site for any info on past or future brides at Secrets the Vine! I saw that you're getting married there April 2016....ME TOO!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm April 9th, when is your date? I haven't started planning anything yet, is your wedding planner Yamina? I'm not sure what the next steps are and I'm not sure if I am too early in trying to start planning it!<br><br>\nHow has your experience been so far? Have you started planning? I was just starting to think about hair\/makeup for me and my bridesmaids. Hopefully we can share some information and help each other because I have NO idea!! lol<br><br>\nThanks!<br>\nNicole<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Nicole,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Glad that you reach out! My date is 4\/23 so just 2 weeks after yours. I am surprised that I didn't find many brides talking about Secrets The Vine on this site... I am glad that your are!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And yes, my planner is Yamina, she is the only wedding coordinator (with one assistant). Are you having a big wedding? Mine is going to be small just around 20 people. Have you sent out your save the date yet? I think the first important thing is to have a good idea of your guest number... then your photographer. \u00a0Are you doing Ultimate package with the resort? The ultimate package already include photography, but I don't think it's sufficient. I booked another photographer for 4 additional hours. So, so far I've done reservation with the resort and additional photographer, save the date, wedding gown purchase, and my travel arrangements.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's kinda hard to plan so far out (both distance and time!)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>KuoLing<\/p>","PostKey":"b735a98a6619f54c25a9c1e4a64fabfe","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":20591,"Author":{"Id":280754,"Name":"NicoleB629","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1443031402,"Content":"<p>Hi KuoLing,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know! \u00a0I was thinking the same thing, I was hoping there would be other brides or past brides that we could talk to or see what their wedding looked like!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\nWe booked the Ultimate Wedding package and have 45 people right now. \u00a0I think the max we will have is about 55-60 but there are still a few people that haven't booked yet. \u00a0I have 5 bridesmaids and they have all ordered their dresses already so I'm glad that's out of the way! \u00a0I did a save the date and I did purchase my dress!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have to figure out the photographer situation. \u00a0Did you book another photographer through the resort? \u00a0Were you going to get your hair and makeup done by someone at the resort? I agree, I chose destination because it was easier then a traditional wedding but there are some tricky parts to it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Nicole<\/p>\n","PostKey":"79b49ac318c8a9f798466b24435b5b4f","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Id":11521,"Subject":"Secrets the Vine - April 2016 Wedding","StartDate":1442837776,"Starter":{"Id":280754,"Name":"NicoleB629","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"To":{"Id":282701,"Name":"kuoling","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282701.jpg?_r=1439869919","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":261,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Preview":{"Id":20591,"Author":{"Id":280754,"Name":"NicoleB629","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1443031402,"Content":"Hi KuoLing,\n\u00a0\nI know! \u00a0I was thinking the same thing, I was hoping there would be other brides or...","PostKey":"79b49ac318c8a9f798466b24435b5b4f","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},"IsRead":true,"IsDeleted":false,"TotalReplies":2,"Notifications":true,"CanReply":true},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
